            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A wearable device (14) comprising: a radio-frequency identification (RFID) tag (34, 36) comprising a memory (48) that stores identification information; one or more LEDs (54) configured to facilitate detection of the wearable device (14) by an external light detector (20); and a microcontroller (38) coupled to the RFID tag (34, 36) and the one or more LEDs (54) and configured to control at least one LED of the one or more LEDs (54) to emit light in response to receipt of electromagnetic radiation from an RFID reader (16, 18) at the RFID tag (34, 36).</p>
            </abstract>
